{
  "_note": "下一个假期(国务院安排)。st:1 还没开始 / 2 放假中 / 0 放假表跑完 → 回落到下一个法定节日当天,不画区间、不猜调休(设计 §4.6)。每年 11 月通知发布后更新 cncal/holiday-cn 并重发。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "at0",
        "value": "${at}"
      },
      "_note": "入参先落地:方法参数里的 ${} 看不见 flow 入参(numable docs df)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "today",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${@time.nowMs},yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      },
      "_note": "本机日期 —— 日历按本地的「今天」对照(设计 §4.8)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "D",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${at0},${today})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "y",
        "value": "$[round::(calc::(subString::(${D},0,4)+0))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "m",
        "value": "$[round::(calc::(subString::(${D},5,7)+0))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "d",
        "value": "$[round::(calc::(subString::(${D},8,10)+0))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tyy",
        "value": "$[calc::(${y}-if::(le::(${m},2),1,0))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tmp",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(${m},2),calc::(${m}-3),calc::(${m}+9))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ter",
        "value": "$[floor::(calc::(${tyy}/400))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tye",
        "value": "$[calc::(${tyy}-${ter}*400)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tdy",
        "value": "$[calc::(floor::(calc::((153*${tmp}+2)/5))+${d}-1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "tdn",
        "value": "$[round::(calc::(${ter}*146097+${tye}*365+floor::(calc::(${tye}/4))-floor::(calc::(${tye}/100))+${tdy}-719468))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "wd",
        "value": "$[round::(calc::(${tdn}+4-floor::(calc::((${tdn}+4)/7))*7))]"
      },
      "_note": "0 = 周日 … 6 = 周六(1970-01-01 是周四)"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "zh",
        "value": "$[if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "HP",
        "value": "20089_20089_1_元旦_New Year_1 月 1 日_Jan 1_0_-_-_1 月 2 日上班_Back to work Jan 2~20116_20123_8_春节_Spring Fest_1 月 28 日—2 月 4 日_Jan 28 – Feb 4_20114:20127_1 月 26 日（周日）:2 月 8 日（周六）_Jan 26 Sun:Feb 8 Sat_2 月 5 日上班_Back to work Feb 5~20182_20184_3_清明节_Qingming_4 月 4 日—4 月 6 日_Apr 4 – Apr 6_0_-_-_4 月 7 日上班_Back to work Apr 7~20209_20213_5_劳动节_Labour Day_5 月 1 日—5 月 5 日_May 1 – May 5_20205_4 月 27 日（周日）_Apr 27 Sun_5 月 6 日上班_Back to work May 6~20239_20241_3_端午节_Dragon Boat_5 月 31 日—6 月 2 日_May 31 – Jun 2_0_-_-_6 月 3 日上班_Back to work Jun 3~20362_20369_8_国庆节_National Day_10 月 1 日—10 月 8 日_Oct 1 – Oct 8_20359:20372_9 月 28 日（周日）:10 月 11 日（周六）_Sep 28 Sun:Oct 11 Sat_10 月 9 日上班_Back to work Oct 9~20454_20456_3_元旦_New Year_1 月 1 日—1 月 3 日_Jan 1 – Jan 3_20457_1 月 4 日（周日）_Jan 4 Sun_1 月 4 日上班_Back to work Jan 4~20499_20507_9_春节_Spring Fest_2 月 15 日—2 月 23 日_Feb 15 – Feb 23_20498:20512_2 月 14 日（周六）:2 月 28 日（周六）_Feb 14 Sat:Feb 28 Sat_2 月 24 日上班_Back to work Feb 24~20547_20549_3_清明节_Qingming_4 月 4 日—4 月 6 日_Apr 4 – Apr 6_0_-_-_4 月 7 日上班_Back to work Apr 7~20574_20578_5_劳动节_Labour Day_5 月 1 日—5 月 5 日_May 1 – May 5_20582_5 月 9 日（周六）_May 9 Sat_5 月 6 日上班_Back to work May 6~20623_20625_3_端午节_Dragon Boat_6 月 19 日—6 月 21 日_Jun 19 – Jun 21_0_-_-_6 月 22 日上班_Back to work Jun 22~20721_20723_3_中秋节_Mid-Autumn_9 月 25 日—9 月 27 日_Sep 25 – Sep 27_0_-_-_9 月 28 日上班_Back to work Sep 28~20727_20733_7_国庆节_National Day_10 月 1 日—10 月 7 日_Oct 1 – Oct 7_20716:20736_9 月 20 日（周日）:10 月 10 日（周六）_Sep 20 Sun:Oct 10 Sat_10 月 8 日上班_Back to work Oct 8"
      },
      "_note": "放假区间(已公布的最近两年):首日_末日_天数_名_英文_区间_英文区间_调休日序_调休显示_英文_上班日_英文"
    },
